{
   "$comment": [
      "The cross-application icon contract. Concept -> Iconify name for a Material Symbol",
      "(Apache-2.0). This file is the shared artifact: the React app resolves these names",
      "through src/icons, and Blazor/ASP.NET applications resolve the SAME names from their",
      "own Iconify or Material Symbols packages. Sharing names is what keeps the",
      "applications consistent -- components never cross framework boundaries.",
      "Style is outline + rounded throughout. Add a concept here BEFORE using an icon for it."
   ],
   "style": "material-symbols outline rounded",
   "modelState": {
      "$comment": [
         "Where a model stands in its lifecycle: who owns it and whether it can be edited.",
         "Separate concepts from the 'ui' action icons even where a glyph coincides --",
         "privateEditable happens to share editDocument's glyph today, and giving each its",
         "own key means changing one later cannot silently change the other.",
         "Resolved by resolveModelStateIcon() in ./resolveModelState.ts."
      ],
      "privateEditable": "material-symbols:edit-document-outline-rounded",
      "privateLocked": "material-symbols:lock-outline-rounded",
      "shared": "material-symbols:document-share-outline-rounded",
      "cloudLibrary": "material-symbols:cloud-outline-rounded"
   },
   "nodeIcon": {
      "$comment": [
         "Instance icons depend on the node's TypeDefinition, not just its NodeClass, so",
         "these are resolved by resolveNodeIcon() in ./resolveNodeIcon.ts -- see that file",
         "for the precedence rules. 'object' and 'dataVariable' double as the defaults for",
         "instances whose TypeDefinition is outside the listed families.",
         "'eventType' and 'condition' share one glyph today but stay separate keys: a",
         "Condition is an event type that also exists as an Object, so the server has to",
         "tell them apart (only 'condition' is inherited by instances -- see NodeIcons.cs)",
         "and splitting them later must not require a server change."
      ],
      "object": "material-symbols:widgets-outline-rounded",
      "folder": "material-symbols:folder-outline-rounded",
      "property": "material-symbols:label-outline-rounded",
      "eventType": "material-symbols:circle-notifications-outline-rounded",
      "condition": "material-symbols:circle-notifications-outline-rounded",
      "dataVariable": "material-symbols:confirmation-number-outline-rounded",
      "method": "material-symbols:function-outline-rounded",
      "view": "material-symbols:folder-eye-outline-rounded",
      "objectType": "material-symbols:space-dashboard-outline-rounded",
      "interfaceType": "material-symbols:graph-8-outline-rounded",
      "variableType": "material-symbols:team-dashboard-outline-rounded",
      "dataType": "material-symbols:grid-layout-side-outline-rounded",
      "referenceType": "material-symbols:network-node-outline-rounded",
      "unknown": "material-symbols:help-outline-rounded"
   },
   "ui": {
      "$comment": [
         "Every other icon in the app, by concept. Filled/outlined variants of one glyph",
         "collapse onto a single concept here -- that duplication (Edit + EditOutlined,",
         "Delete + DeleteOutline, Visibility + VisibilityOutlined, ...) is what made the UI",
         "look inconsistent. src/icons/index.tsx generates one component per entry.",
         "NOTE: Material Symbols has no brand marks, so the Microsoft logo is not here --",
         "MicrosoftIcon stays a MUI passthrough in the registry."
      ],
      "add": "material-symbols:add-outline-rounded",
      "arrowBack": "material-symbols:arrow-back-outline-rounded",
      "arrowBackIos": "material-symbols:arrow-back-ios-new-outline-rounded",
      "arrowForward": "material-symbols:arrow-forward-outline-rounded",
      "autoFix": "material-symbols:auto-fix-normal-outline-rounded",
      "callSplit": "material-symbols:call-split-outline-rounded",
      "cancel": "material-symbols:cancel-outline-rounded",
      "category": "material-symbols:category-outline-rounded",
      "check": "material-symbols:check-outline-rounded",
      "chevronRight": "material-symbols:chevron-right-outline-rounded",
      "close": "material-symbols:close-outline-rounded",
      "clone": "material-symbols:file-copy-outline-rounded",
      "contentCopy": "material-symbols:content-copy-outline-rounded",
      "darkMode": "material-symbols:dark-mode-outline-rounded",
      "delete": "material-symbols:delete-outline-rounded",
      "description": "material-symbols:description-outline-rounded",
      "download": "material-symbols:download-outline-rounded",
      "email": "material-symbols:mail-outline-rounded",
      "error": "material-symbols:error-outline-rounded",
      "expandMore": "material-symbols:expand-more-rounded",
      "factCheck": "material-symbols:fact-check-outline-rounded",
      "filterCenterFocus": "material-symbols:filter-center-focus-outline-rounded",
      "folder": "material-symbols:folder-outline-rounded",
      "history": "material-symbols:history-outline-rounded",
      "home": "material-symbols:home-outline-rounded",
      "help": "material-symbols:help-outline-rounded",
      "info": "material-symbols:info-outline-rounded",
      "keyboardArrowDown": "material-symbols:keyboard-arrow-down-outline-rounded",
      "keyboardArrowUp": "material-symbols:keyboard-arrow-up-outline-rounded",
      "listAlt": "material-symbols:list-alt-outline-rounded",
      "lock": "material-symbols:lock-outline-rounded",
      "lockOpen": "material-symbols:lock-open-outline-rounded",
      "login": "material-symbols:login-outline-rounded",
      "logout": "material-symbols:logout-outline-rounded",
      "menu": "material-symbols:menu-outline-rounded",
      "moreHoriz": "material-symbols:more-horiz-outline-rounded",
      "myLocation": "material-symbols:my-location-outline-rounded",
      "person": "material-symbols:person-outline-rounded",
      "playArrow": "material-symbols:play-arrow-outline-rounded",
      "playlistAdd": "material-symbols:playlist-add-outline-rounded",
      "refresh": "material-symbols:refresh-outline-rounded",
      "restartAlt": "material-symbols:restart-alt-outline-rounded",
      "schema": "material-symbols:schema-outline-rounded",
      "science": "material-symbols:science-outline-rounded",
      "search": "material-symbols:search-outline-rounded",
      "subdirectoryArrowRight": "material-symbols:subdirectory-arrow-right-outline-rounded",
      "taskAlt": "material-symbols:task-alt-outline-rounded",
      "uploadFile": "material-symbols:upload-file-outline-rounded",
      "visibility": "material-symbols:visibility-outline-rounded",
      "visibilityOff": "material-symbols:visibility-off-outline-rounded",
      "warning": "material-symbols:warning-outline-rounded",
      "widgets": "material-symbols:widgets-outline-rounded",
      "accountTree": "material-symbols:account-tree-outline-rounded",
      "edit": "material-symbols:edit-outline-rounded",
      "editDocument": "material-symbols:edit-document-outline-rounded"
   }
}
